{
  "_about": [
    "Feat loop, batch 2, styles lane (2026-11-22): the style feats and their follow-ups, and the",
    "reroll and once-a-day luck feats. Each benefit is the book's (the benefit text in feats.json,",
    "from aonprd.com / d20pfsrd.com). A style is a stance (rules/styles.py): its follow-ups ask",
    "`bearer.state` for `style.<id>`, and a base style's clauses not prefaced by 'while using this",
    "style' hold always. Luck is a document's `luck` list, read by rules/luck.py at the engine's",
    "d20 doors. What still does not run is the document's `not_yet`."
  ],
  "dauntless-destiny": {
    "modifiers": [
      {
        "type": "save_mod",
        "target": "fort",
        "amount": 1,
        "bonus_type": "untyped",
        "when": {
          "against": "emotion"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "save_mod",
        "target": "ref",
        "amount": 1,
        "bonus_type": "untyped",
        "when": {
          "against": "emotion"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "save_mod",
        "target": "will",
        "amount": 1,
        "bonus_type": "untyped",
        "when": {
          "against": "emotion"
        }
      }
    ],
    "luck": [
      {
        "reroll": "natural_1",
        "rolls": [
          "save",
          "attack"
        ],
        "per_day": 1,
        "not_against": [
          "trap"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "not_yet": [
      "the free-action Intimidate to demoralize after a reroll that succeeds: no door demoralizes as a free action off a roll"
    ]
  },
  "inexplicable-luck": {
    "luck": [
      {
        "bonus": {
          "before": 8,
          "after": 4
        },
        "rolls": [
          "d20"
        ],
        "per_day": 1
      }
    ],
    "not_yet": [
      "initiative, concentration and the saves a hazard rolls for you (cold, heat): only the attack roll, a save the turn or a spell calls for, and a skill or ability check carry luck"
    ]
  },
  "close-call": {
